  "narration": {
    "pattern_romaji": "A wa B desu (B = an i-adjective)",
    "pattern_jp": "AはBです（B＝い形容詞）",
    "pattern_english": "A is B (B = a describing word like cute, expensive, cheap)",
    "slots": [
      {
        "slot": "A",
        "fits": "The topic: a thing, person or place, e.g. これ, それ, このシャツ"
      },
      {
        "slot": "B",
        "fits": "An い-adjective, a describing word that ends in い: かわいい (cute), たかい (expensive), やすい (cheap), さむい (cold)"
      }
    ],
    "segments": [
      {
        "kind": "en",
        "text": "Welcome back! Today's pattern is {AはBです}, where B is a describing word. It means: A is B. For example, this shirt is cute.",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching"
      },
      {
        "kind": "en",
        "text": "You already know this skeleton from nouns. Today, the B slot holds an adjective instead of a noun.",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching"
      },
      {
        "kind": "en",
        "text": "Slot A is the topic, the thing you're talking about. The little word {は} marks it, like saying, 'as for this.'",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching"
      },
      {
        "kind": "en",
        "text": "Slot B is the describing word. Today's describing words all end in the sound {い}. Here are three: {かわいい}, cute. {たかい}, expensive. {やすい}, cheap.",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching"
      },
      {
        "kind": "en",
        "text": "And {です} comes last, as always. It makes the sentence polite and finished. In English, 'is' goes in the middle. In Japanese, the describing word comes first, then {です} at the very end.",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching"
      },
      {
        "kind": "en",
        "text": "Let's build one. Start with the topic: this shirt.",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching"
      },
      {
        "kind": "jp",
        "text": "このシャツ",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching"
      },
      {
        "kind": "en",
        "text": "That's 'this shirt.' Now add the topic marker.",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching"
      },
      {
        "kind": "jp",
        "text": "このシャツは",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching"
      },
      {
        "kind": "en",
        "text": "'As for this shirt...' Now add 'cute' and finish with {です}.",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching"
      },
      {
        "kind": "jp",
        "text": "このシャツはかわいいです。",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching"
      },
      {
        "kind": "en",
        "text": "This shirt is cute.",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching"
      },
      {
        "kind": "en",
        "text": "Here's another one, about a price. Start with 'that.'",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching"
      },
      {
        "kind": "jp",
        "text": "それ",
        "speaker": "B",
        "speed": "teaching"
      },
      {
        "kind": "jp",
        "text": "それは",
        "speaker": "B",
        "speed": "teaching"
      },
      {
        "kind": "en",
        "text": "'As for that...' Now add 'expensive' and {です}.",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching"
      },
      {
        "kind": "jp",
        "text": "それはたかいです。",
        "speaker": "B",
        "speed": "teaching"
      },
      {
        "kind": "en",
        "text": "That's expensive.",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching"
      },
      {
        "kind": "en",
        "text": "One more. Start with 'this,' add {は}, then 'cheap.'",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching"
      },
      {
        "kind": "jp",
        "text": "これ",
        "speaker": "B",
        "speed": "teaching"
      },
      {
        "kind": "jp",
        "text": "これは",
        "speaker": "B",
        "speed": "teaching"
      },
      {
        "kind": "jp",
        "text": "これはやすいです。",
        "speaker": "B",
        "speed": "teaching"
      },
      {
        "kind": "en",
        "text": "This is cheap.",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching"
      },
      {
        "kind": "en",
        "text": "Now a swap. Keep 'this shirt,' and just change the describing word.",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching"
      },
      {
